# ============================================
# LingNote - MVP 项目 Git 忽略规则
# ============================================

### IDE 配置 (不提交 IDE 私有配置) ###
.idea/
*.iml
*.ipr
*.iws
.vscode/
*.code-workspace

### 依赖目录 (不提交，由包管理器安装) ###
node_modules/
**/node_modules/

### 构建产物 (不提交，由构建工具生成) ###
dist/
build/
**/dist/
**/build/

### 环境配置 (包含敏感信息) ###
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
.env.*
application.properties
**/.env

### 日志文件 ###
*.log
logs/

### 操作系统文件 ###
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

### 临时文件 ###
*.tmp
*.swp
*.swo
*~

### Java/Spring Boot ###
target/
HELP.md
.mvn/
*.jar
*.war
*.ear
# Keep generated sources under src/
!**/src/main/**/target/
!**/src/test/**/target/
!**/src/main/**/build/
!**/src/test/**/build/

### STS / Eclipse ###
.apt_generated
.classpath
.factorypath
.project
.settings
.springBeans
.sts4-cache

### NetBeans ###
/nbproject/private/
/nbbuild/
/nbdist/
/.nb-gradle/

### Frontend ###
package-lock.json
*.lock

### 本地数据/缓存 ###
.cache/
coverage/
